- Full governance platform: PostgreSQL, semantic search, full dashboard, team management, MCP server, GitHub Actions, CSV export
- Self-hosted Docker (customer's infrastructure)
- Target: engineering teams at product companies, agencies, Series A–C startups (5–50 developers)

**Max** — Contact sales (annual contract)
- Everything in Plus + Neo4j graph lineage + full vector + graph search
- Multi-workspace, compliance-ready, production deployment
