### MCP Server (`lineagelens-mcp/`)

**`lineagelens-mcp/lineagelens-mcp.py`**
MCP server built with `FastMCP`. Communicates over stdio. Authenticates against the LineageLens backend using either a static JWT or auto-login with username + password. Token caching with automatic re-login on 401. Seven tools: `search_provenance`, `get_record`, `get_insights`, `explain_record`, `list_recent`, `check_file_risk`, `usage_report`. Wire into Claude Code via `~/.claude/settings.json` or into Cursor via MCP settings.

**`lineagelens-mcp/lineagelens-mcp-requirements.txt`**
MCP server dependencies: `mcp>=1.0.0`, `httpx>=0.27.0`. Install with `pip install -r lineagelens-mcp-requirements.txt`.

