### GitHub Actions (`.github/`)

**`.github/workflows/lineagelens-annotate.yml`**
PR Annotation workflow. Fires on `pull_request` opened/synchronized/reopened. Gets the list of changed files, calls `lineagelens-annotate.mjs` to fetch provenance records for those files from the backend, and posts a structured comment to the PR. Deletes previous LineageLens bot comments to avoid duplicates.

**`.github/lineagelens-scripts/lineagelens-annotate.mjs`**
Node.js script that queries `POST /search` for each changed file, formats the results as a markdown PR comment with AI-generated line annotations, risk badges, model names, and prompt previews, and writes the comment body to `LINEAGELENS_COMMENT` for the workflow to post.

**`.github/workflows/provenance-review.yml`**
Provenance Review Bot workflow. Fires on non-draft PRs. Calls `provenance_pr_review.py` to generate a structured AI lineage report and posts it as a PR comment. Also supports `workflow_dispatch` for manual invocation with a PR number. Skips gracefully when backend secrets are not configured.

**`.github/lineagelens-scripts/provenance_pr_review.py`**
Python script that queries the LineageLens backend for all provenance records touching the PR's changed files, groups them by file, computes risk summaries, and formats a structured markdown report with risk scores, model attribution, and prompt previews.

**`.github/agents/lineagelens-backend-debugger.agent.md`**
Claude agent instructions file. Provides context for a debugging agent that helps diagnose LineageLens backend issues.

