### Deploy (`lineagelens-deploy/`)

**`lineagelens-deploy/docker-compose.base.yml`**
Docker Compose for Base tier: `postgres` (pgvector/pgvector:pg16) + `backend` (builds from `lineagelens-backend/Dockerfile`). No Neo4j, no proxy container. `BACKEND_MODE=solo`.

**`lineagelens-deploy/docker-compose.plus.yml`**
Docker Compose for Plus tier: `postgres` + `backend` + `proxy` (runs `lineagelens-proxy/proxy.py`). `BACKEND_MODE=team`. Larger connection pool settings.

**`lineagelens-deploy/docker-compose.max.yml`**
Docker Compose for Max tier: `postgres` + `neo4j` (official `neo4j` image) + `backend` + `proxy`. `BACKEND_MODE=enterprise`, `NEO4J_ENABLED=true`. Neo4j health check waits up to 90s.

